  "term": "functional brain imaging",
  "definition": "Functional brain imaging is the non-invasive measurement of brain activity to show how the brain is functioning. In this packet, it refers to magnetoencephalography methods that detect magnetic signals from the brain and can locate activity with high spatial accuracy.",
